#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""cleanup: scan, clean and recover disk space, RAM and Claude Code memory.

Run with no arguments for a menu. Run `cleanup --help` for every option.
Nothing is changed by a scan. Clean always keeps a way back under ~/.cleanup-trash/.
"""

